Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person1:
	.string "Even fishermen come to HEARTHOME.\n"
	.string "It's the city of friendship, after all.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person2:
	.string "AMITY SQUARE is the only place in town\n"
	.string "where you can walk with your MOéMON\l"
	.string "outside its ball. Well, small ones.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person3:
	.string "The CONTEST HALL is always packed.\n"
	.string "Everyone wants to see the newest\l"
	.string "moves.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person5:
	.string "My MOéMON and I came all the way from\n"
	.string "the coast for the POFFIN HOUSE. Worth\l"
	.string "it!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person6:
	.string "The FAN CLUB president loves hearing\n"
	.string "about your MOéMON. Just don't get him\l"
	.string "started on his own.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person7:
	.string "I make little MOéMON statues out of\n"
	.string "clay. Want to see? ...Well, they're still\l"
	.string "drying.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person8:
	.string "We train together every morning, then\n"
	.string "get a POFFIN as a reward!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person9:
	.string "FANTINA at the GYM dances when she\n"
	.string "battles. I want to battle like that\l"
	.string "someday!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person10:
	.string "I came down from the mountains to see\n"
	.string "the city. It's so loud! But nice.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person11:
	.string "PACHIRISU: Chipa! Chipaaa!\p"
	.string "It's stuffing its cheeks with\n"
	.string "something.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person27:
	.string "I came to HEARTHOME to make friends.\n"
	.string "My MOéMON made three before I made\l"
	.string "one!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person28:
	.string "Hoo-ha! My training spot is behind the\n"
	.string "GYM. Don't tell anyone.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person30:
	.string "I'm looking for the perfect POFFIN\n"
	.string "recipe. I think it's mostly about\l"
	.string "patience.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person35:
	.string "The light here at sunset is perfect\n"
	.string "for painting. I come every day and\l"
	.string "never finish.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Person36:
	.string "A true fighter trains the heart too.\n"
	.string "That's why I come to HEARTHOME!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign12:
	.string "HEARTHOME CITY\p"
	.string "West: ROUTE 208$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign13:
	.string "HEARTHOME CITY\p"
	.string "East: ROUTE 209$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign14:
	.string "AMITY SQUARE\p"
	.string "West gate. A park for TRAINERS and\n"
	.string "their MOéMON.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign15:
	.string "MOéMON CONTEST HALL\p"
	.string "Show the world your MOéMON's style!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign16:
	.string "AMITY SQUARE\p"
	.string "East gate. A park for TRAINERS and\n"
	.string "their MOéMON.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign17:
	.string "MOéMON FAN CLUB\p"
	.string "Everyone who loves MOéMON is welcome.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign18:
	.string "HEARTHOME CITY MOéMON GYM\p"
	.string "LEADER: FANTINA\p"
	.string "The dancing GHOST!$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign19:
	.string "HEARTHOME CITY\p"
	.string "The warm city where people and MOéMON\n"
	.string "gather.$"

Sinnoh_HearthomeCity_Text_Sign31:
	.string "POFFIN HOUSE\p"
	.string "Treats for your MOéMON, made with\n"
	.string "love.$"

